{"4435920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fifth Sun: Coop racing", "steam_appid": 4435920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifth Sun: Coop Racing is an incredibly fast game where you can run solo or share the cockpit with a friend who handles the shooting. Shooting your opponents down  or being faster than them are both viable strategies. This game is still in development. As such, the story is still not complete and neither are the tracks nor ships. We will upload monthly updates. Join our discord channel to help us guide the development process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 ships run on the track at the same time, each with a completely unique set of abilities including giant lasers, throwing raccoons at other ships, and teleportation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/0ebb9174b9bd204ac48fb75fa05e7390.poster.avif?t=1784698937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/0ebb9174b9bd204ac48fb75fa05e7390.webm?t=1784698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/0ebb9174b9bd204ac48fb75fa05e7390.mp4?t=1784698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 60-character (30 ships, each with a pilot and a gunner) roster includes larger-than-life racers with unique biographies, many of whom are inspired by Latinamerican culture, including wrestlers, mariachis, and ghosts from folklore... some tracks may also be inspired by Mexica or Mayan myths! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/c28e02998040d761d021dba489c71254.avif?t=1784698937\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ship's statistics in an intense story, where you play as Laura and Meztli as they navigate the complexities of a Grand Prix while juggling their daily lives.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifth Sun: Coop Racing is an incredibly fast game where you can run solo or share the cockpit with a friend who handles the shooting. Shooting your opponents down  or being faster than them are both viable strategies. This game is still in development. As such, the story is still not complete and neither are the tracks nor ships. We will upload monthly updates. Join our discord channel to help us guide the development process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 ships run on the track at the same time, each with a completely unique set of abilities including giant lasers, throwing raccoons at other ships, and teleportation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/0ebb9174b9bd204ac48fb75fa05e7390.poster.avif?t=1784698937\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/0ebb9174b9bd204ac48fb75fa05e7390.webm?t=1784698937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/0ebb9174b9bd204ac48fb75fa05e7390.mp4?t=1784698937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 60-character (30 ships, each with a pilot and a gunner) roster includes larger-than-life racers with unique biographies, many of whom are inspired by Latinamerican culture, including wrestlers, mariachis, and ghosts from folklore... some tracks may also be inspired by Mexica or Mayan myths! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/extras/c28e02998040d761d021dba489c71254.avif?t=1784698937\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ship's statistics in an intense story, where you play as Laura and Meztli as they navigate the complexities of a Grand Prix while juggling their daily lives.</p>", "short_description": "Run solo or share the ship's cockpit with a friend. Use the ship's unique abilities to outmaneuver or outlast your opponents in cylinders, flight sections, and other crazy hazards. A player shoots while the other one runs, and if you're fast enough or aggressive enough, you might win the Grand Prix!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/1211aed2018a27426a835362e3731991a7ca3cb3/header.jpg?t=1784698937", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/b61052c23e97dcb47e056aa41001864451016433/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784698937", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4435920/b61052c23e97dcb47e056aa41001864451016433/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784698937", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Celeron G5905<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel® UHD Graphics 610<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><stron